  "description": {
    "raw": "You grant the target a dodge bonus to its Armor Class against attacks from larger creatures. The bonus is equal to +1 for every size category the attacker is larger than the target of the spell, to a maximum of +1 per 3 caster levels. If the spell’s target is a gnome, the maximum bonus is equal to +1 per 2 caster levels.",
    "search_text": "\"you grant the target a dodge bonus to its armor class against attacks from larger creatures. the bonus is equal to +1 for every size category the attacker is larger than the target of the spell, to a maximum of +1 per 3 caster levels. if the spell’s target is a gnome, the maximum bonus is equal to +1 per 2 caster levels.\"",
